        "quote": "您右侧乳腺BI-RADS 4B结节恶性概率大约10%-50%，是目前最需要优先明确性质的问题，肯定要放在甲状腺和肺结节前面处理"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00037",
        "explanation": "Doctor correctly differentiates biopsy vs direct excision options and maps them to the patient’s question without defaulting to either.",
        "quote": "两种方案都是临床常用的选择，各有优势"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00163",
        "explanation": "Doctor recalls and integrates the patient’s earlier anxiety about being alone and the need for family support into the plan for the admission and surgery.",
        "quote": "您现在可以顺路去一楼入院处或者乳腺外科B区的护士台，把这张住院证交过去登记排床"
