        "event_id": "lite_evt_00163",
        "explanation": "Doctor translates the confusing admission paperwork into a concrete, step-by-step process: register at the nurse station, go home, wait for a phone call.",
        "quote": "您现在可以顺路去一楼入院处或者乳腺外科B区的护士台，把这张住院证交过去登记排床"
      }
    ]
  },
  "dimension_ratings": {
