          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly states that the current plan is to register and wait, while the thyroid and lung results are not yet complete and will be addressed later, bounding the residual uncertainty.",
          "quote": "现在完全不需要空腹，正常吃饭喝水就可以；只有等通知入院、手术前一天晚上医生/护士会提前告诉您什么时候开始禁食禁水"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00354",
          "explanation": "Doctor confirms what is and is not resolved at closure: the breast plan is set, but pathology and follow-up for other nodules remain to be confirmed.",
          "quote": "现在您完全可以先安心：医生的判断就是「目前这一关不用追加大手术、化疗放疗」"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 is triggered when the patient needs to know what is definitively resolved and what remains to be done. The doctor clarifies the boundaries: the admission is arranged, but the final pathology and the management of thyroid and lung nodules are still pending and will be addressed after recovery.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
